id: pm-linear-thread-capture
title: Capture selected Linear threads as revisioned evidence notes
description: "Explicit selection only. Acceptance: reimport deduplicates; source edits remain visible; no background discussion harvesting or implicit item creation. Provide typed SDK and CLI, controlled metadata/text disclosure, actionable refusals, compact TOON/JSON, non-git support, README example, public-tracker validation, and npm/Bun CI release gates."
type: Feature
status: closed
priority: 2
tags[3]: added,context,linear
created_at: "2026-10-23T16:43:45.503Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-24T23:11:53.773Z"
closed_at: "2026-10-24T21:46:43.540Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-23T17:45:25.000Z"
author: codex-agent
resolution: Captures explicitly selected discussions as source-identified revisioned evidence notes with repeat-capture stability and real non-git SDK/CLI validation.
expected_result: "Explicit selection only. Acceptance: reimport deduplicates; source edits remain visible; no background discussion harvesting or implicit item creation. Provide typed SDK and CLI, controlled metadata/text disclosure, actionable refusals, compact TOON/JSON, non-git support, README example, public-tracker validation, and npm/Bun CI release gates."
actual_result: "https://github.com/unbraind/pm-linear/pull/167, merged 2026-10-23T17:45:25Z, merge cf4fa0adfa5033fea142acbbc94bf39200bf9ec6: Captures explicitly selected discussions as source-identified revisioned evidence notes with repeat-capture stability and real non-git SDK/CLI validation."
comments[6]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-23T16:44:38.213Z",codex-agent,"Overlap rechecked against current CLI notes/context, pm-review and pm-observer. Core provides notes with lock-scoped ifAbsent; review owns GitHub code-review findings and observer owns explicit agent exports. Linear discussion evidence remains provider-specific. Design: explicit root comment plus direct replies only; preview by default, metadata-only disclosure by default, text requires opt-in, apply requires reviewed revision and an existing target. SDK owns target reads, note appends, history and replay deduplication. No item creation, git subprocess, discovery, watchers or provider mutations. SDK pin remains unchanged; CLI registry is 2026.10.23. Targeted local checks and unchanged npm/Bun CI release gates will verify the result."
  "2026-10-23T16:55:12.185Z",codex-agent,"Targeted regressions passed 32/32. Behavioral revert proof: removing SDK ifAbsent made concurrent replay append twice; suppressing body digests made stale source edits pass review. Both mutations failed the selected regression and were restored. Public-derived validation exposed native note output bounding after accumulated evidence; the capture reader now explicitly requests unbounded SDK notes and certifies total_count, preserving complete replay and revision comparison. Added a large-history regression. No SDK pin or release threshold changed."
  "2026-10-23T16:57:41.080Z",codex-agent,"Public-data validation passed on a read-only non-git copy of the public main tracker at 90a0487: 104 corpus items; 20 selected title-derived Linear-shaped threads; 20 appended notes; 20 replay duplicates; 20 source edits visible; maximum JSON proposal 780 bytes; all 216 source files hash-identical. Source attribution in this transport fixture is synthetic; live Linear discussions were not accessed. The targeted suite is recorded through pm test. Typecheck, test typecheck and docstrings pass; pm-ops lint on the two changed TypeScript files reports zero new findings against seven inherited loader findings. Full npm/Bun gates will run in CI at unchanged thresholds."
  "2026-10-23T17:06:39.708Z",codex-agent,"PR https://github.com/unbraind/pm-linear/pull/167 is ready for review. Initial exact-head CI https://github.com/unbraind/pm-linear/actions/runs/39991624000 passed all four jobs: npm and Bun release gates each passed 361 tests with zero failures/skips; index coverage 99.71 lines, 97.21 branches, 100 functions. Node 22/26 jobs also passed. Final inspection added bounded hexadecimal validation for prior capture revisions so malformed local metadata cannot become disclosed revision text. The new refusal and large-history regressions pass locally; typecheck, test typecheck and docstrings pass. Final CI will rerun on the handoff commit. Linear snapshot atomicity and live provider access remain explicitly unverified. Automated review services supplied no completed substantive review; this is ready for human review, not approval or merge."
  "2026-10-23T17:24:04.256Z",codex-agent,"Blocking review accepted: capture tokens currently bind only source, item ID and disclosure, allowing cross-tracker reuse for the same item ID. Remote PR head is current and main has not advanced. Fix will bind an opaque digest of the SDK-resolved canonical tracker root and stable settings identity; paths remain absent from proposals and notes. Regression will use two non-git trackers with identical existing item IDs, verify cross-tracker apply refuses without a write, retain same-tracker replay and alias behavior, and fail with only destination binding reverted."
  "2026-10-23T17:27:36.041Z",codex-agent,"Blocking destination-binding fix complete: preview tokens now hash destination identity derived from SDK resolvePmRoot, canonical filesystem root and SDK readSettings id_prefix, alongside item ID and the complete proposal. The PM client is pinned to that canonical root; raw paths are never emitted or stored in notes. Test reviewed capture tokens cannot cross trackers with the same item ID uses two real non-git trackers with identical existing IDs and settings prefixes; cross-tracker text apply refuses source_changed with all destination files unchanged, same-tracker apply/replay works, and storage/workspace/symlink aliases retain the token. Revert proof: removed only trackerIdentity from the revision hash, kept the test and all other behavior, and the test failed with Missing expected rejection at cross-tracker apply; restored the binding and the test passed. Targeted suite passed 35/35 with zero failures/skips via pm test --run --only-index 1 --progress; focused linked test passed 1/1 via index 3. npm run typecheck, npm run build:test, npm run docstring and diff checks passed. Fleet lint reports zero new findings against seven inherited loader findings. Full unchanged npm and Bun release gates will rerun in CI on the pushed fix."
